        "description": "Lack of extraskeletal abnormalities such as organ involvement",
        "category": "supportive",
        "requiredForDiagnosis": false
      }
    ],
    "minimumForDiagnosis": "Presence of short trunk dwarfism with platyspondyly and metaphyseal abnormalities on imaging",
    "notes": "Diagnosis is primarily clinical and radiological; genetic testing for PAPSS2 mutations can confirm diagnosis."
